tRectangle":{"y":159.96852111816406,"x":-0.82697749826002109,"width":479.96875,"height":268.09375}},{"text":"IMG_0743.jpeg","targetRectangle":{"y":159.86961591243744,"x":480.45406928658485,"width":479.96875,"height":268.09375}},{"text":"Have you forgotten my Embrace?","targetRectangle":{"y":453.08300775289536,"x":529.40155029296875,"width":381.57600000000002,"height":28.3038330078125}},{"text":"Screenshot 2026-06-09 at 11.24.05 AM.png","targetRectangle":{"y":960.772705078125,"x":1440.7906875610352,"width":253,"height":63}},{"text":"Four orchestrated rooms will inter-connect taking audiences on a journey from the bustling streets of Omotesando to a peaceful embrace reconnecting them to ","targetRectangle":{"y":528.59003466367722,"x":97.362769569599095,"width":1568.5120000000006,"height":26.384002685546875}},{"text":"nature and a self awareness that they are One With Nature.","targetRectangle":{"y":555.59003466367722,"x":97.362769569599095,"width":578.66599999999994,"height":26.384002685546875}},{"text":"\\u2028Note: the above images are thematic for each room as paintings and installation is in the process of creation.\\u2028\\u2028Sound will be a big part to engage the senses of the visitors so to transiting through the feelings of the above images would be really key - going from ambient wind and birdsong fading in on entry, crashing waves, deep earth rumbles, silence with a single breath - it would sound incredible on Denon’s Hi-Res Audio certification \\u2028\\u20284つの部屋が有機的につながり、来場者を表参道の喧騒から自然との穏やかな邂逅へと誘う旅へ導きます。その旅の終わりに、人々は自分自身が「One With Nature」——自然と一体であることに気づきます。","targetRectangle":{"y":582.59003466367722,"x":97.362769569599095,"width":1779.0519999999999,"height":221.38400268554688}},{"text":"注：上記の画像は各部屋のテーマをイメージしたものであり、絵画とインスタレーションは現在制作中です。来場者の感覚に深く働きかけるために、サウンドが展示の重要な柱となります。入室時に静かに忍び込む風の音と鳥のさえずり、打ち砕ける波、大地の深い鼓動、そしてひとつの呼吸だけが残る静寂へ——それぞれの情景が持つ感情を音で体験しながら部屋を移っていく体験は、DENONのハイレゾオーディオ認証技術によって、息をのむほどの臨場感で再現されます。","targetRectangle":{"y":814.97405964136124,"x":97.362769